# Switching icons to none in the settings window while Overdue and Flagged views are open redraws their headers and chips with the fallback glyphs at once.
file <<END
Work:
	- Write report @due({today-2})
	- Fix the shelf @flag
END
keys gO <C-w> s gF g,
see Settings
keys /
type icons
keys <Enter> <Enter>
see none
keys <Down> <Enter> <Esc>
see ! Overdue
see ⚐ Flagged
see - Fix the shelf ⚐  Work
see ! 2 days ago
quit
